<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE V INDIA MATCH DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE V INDIA MATCH DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day cricket match</p>
<p>between Free State and India ended in a draw on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Free State 320-7 declared and 259-2 declared;</p>
<p>India 296-6 declared and 185-6.</p>
</text>
